              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aramusubiza ati “Nushaka kuba utunganye rwose, genda ugurishe ibyo utunze maze uhe abakene, ni bwo uzagira ubutunzi mu ijuru, uhereko uze unkurikire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
