              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu arabitegereza arababwira ati “Ibyo ntibishobokera abantu, ariko ku Mana byose birashoboka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.26",
